  "title": "Creamy, Dreamy Vegan Fudge Pops",
  "description": "Simply blend and freeze coconut milk, cocoa powder, almond extract, and fresh raspberries to make these creamy, dreamy, homemade vegan fudge pops.",
  "authors": [
    "Myrna Sobernheim"
  ],
